# COMPONENT

## ToolchainRunner

### PACKAGE

org.simplemodeling.textus.toolchainrunner

### DESCRIPTION

Textus component that exposes the existing Cozy toolchain Docker image as
artifact conversion operations. The component does not own a specific artifact
domain; it runs installed toolchain commands in a controlled Docker workspace.

# SERVICE

## Toolchain

### DESCRIPTION

Operations for converting and inspecting generated artifacts through the Cozy
toolchain Docker image.

### OPERATION

#### convertSvgToPdf

Converts one SVG file to one PDF file by running the `svg-pages-to-pdf`
toolchain command inside the Cozy toolchain Docker image.

##### TYPE

QUERY

##### INPUT

###### TYPE
ConvertSvgToPdfQuery

###### VALUE

####### ConvertSvgToPdfQuery

######## EXTENDS

QueryAction

######## ATTRIBUTE

| name          | type   | multiplicity |
|---------------+--------+--------------|
| svg           | string | 1            |
| out           | string | ?            |
| dockerImage   | string | ?            |
| dockerCommand | string | ?            |
| workDir       | string | ?            |

##### OUTPUT

###### TYPE
ToolchainArtifactResult

###### VALUE

####### ToolchainArtifactResult

######## EXTENDS

OperationResult

######## ATTRIBUTE

| name         | type    | multiplicity |
|--------------+---------+--------------|
| valid        | boolean | 1            |
| errorCount   | int     | 1            |
| warningCount | int     | 1            |
| message      | string  | 1            |
| out          | string  | 1            |
| pageCount    | int     | 1            |
| dockerImage  | string  | 1            |

#### convertSvgPagesToPdf

Converts multiple SVG files to a single multi-page PDF by running the
`svg-pages-to-pdf` toolchain command inside the Cozy toolchain Docker image.

##### TYPE

QUERY

##### INPUT

###### TYPE
ConvertSvgPagesToPdfQuery

###### VALUE

####### ConvertSvgPagesToPdfQuery

######## EXTENDS

QueryAction

######## ATTRIBUTE

| name          | type   | multiplicity |
|---------------+--------+--------------|
| svgFiles      | string | 1            |
| out           | string | ?            |
| dockerImage   | string | ?            |
| dockerCommand | string | ?            |
| workDir       | string | ?            |

##### OUTPUT

###### TYPE
ToolchainArtifactResult

###### VALUE

####### ToolchainArtifactResult

######## EXTENDS

OperationResult

######## ATTRIBUTE

| name         | type    | multiplicity |
|--------------+---------+--------------|
| valid        | boolean | 1            |
| errorCount   | int     | 1            |
| warningCount | int     | 1            |
| message      | string  | 1            |
| out          | string  | 1            |
| pageCount    | int     | 1            |
| dockerImage  | string  | 1            |
